(defrule registry -> registry-components registry-schema registry-dispatch decisions)
(defrule registry-components -> :instruction "道具の仕組みを分ける関心を 1 文で書く" :sample "The tool system separates schema construction, dispatch routing, and lifecycle hooks into distinct components.")
(defrule registry-schema -> :instruction "道具の定義を集める部品と、集める出どころを 1 文で書く" :sample "ToolSchemaBuilder assembles JSON schemas from three sources: (1) static _BUILTIN_TOOL_SCHEMAS defining approximately 40 built-in tools, with descriptions loaded from markdown templates via load_tool_description(); (2) dynamically discovered MCP schemas, including only those tools in the _discovered_mcp_tools set to avoid context bloat; and (3) subagent schemas injected by the SubAgentManager when present.")
(defrule registry-dispatch -> :instruction "呼び出しを取り扱い部品へ配る部品を 1 文で書く" :sample "ToolRegistry serves as the central dispatcher, mapping tool names to handler methods across 12 handler classes organized by category (file, process, web, notebook, user interaction, task management, thinking, MCP discovery, batch execution; see Table 1 in Appendix A for the complete mapping).")
(defrule decisions -> :instruction "道具の仕組みで下した設計の決定を、1 行に 1 つ決定の名前で挙げる。道具の分類、拡張のためのフック、承認の門、消せない危険の規則、承認の規則の保存のうち、このハーネスにあるもの" :frame "opendev.design-decision.lisp")
